# Plan

## State Model

### Backend
```
RoomStatus: "lobby" | "playing" | "finished"

Participant:
  id, name, joinedAt, isHost, score, isDrawer

Room:
  code, status, participants[], createdAt, updatedAt,
  word (secret, current round word),
  drawingData (canvas state),
  guesses[] { participantId, name, text, correct }
```

### Frontend (`RoomSnapshot`)
```
RoomSnapshot:
  code, status, participants[],
  word (only visible if viewer is drawer),
  drawingData,
  guesses[],
  viewerRole: "drawer" | "guesser"
```

## Data Flow
- All sync via HTTP polling (GET /rooms/:code every ~2s).
- Canvas drawn → POST /rooms/:code/drawing (save stroke data).
- Guess submitted → POST /rooms/:code/guess.
- Start game → POST /rooms/:code/start (host only).
- Restart → POST /rooms/:code/restart (host only).

## File-Level Plan

### Backend
| File | Change |
|------|--------|
| `models/game.ts` | Add `isHost`, `score`, `isDrawer` to Participant. Add `drawingData`, `guesses`, `word` to Room. Extend `RoomStatus`. |
| `api/schemas.ts` | Add schemas for drawing, guess, start, restart endpoints. Validate name (trim, reject empty). |
| `api/rooms.ts` | Add routes: start, restart, save drawing, submit guess. |
| `services/roomStore.ts` | Add game logic: startGame, submitGuess, saveDrawing, restartGame. Filter word per-viewer in `toRoomSnapshot`. |
| `seed/starterData.ts` | Keep as-is. |

### Frontend
| File | Change |
|------|--------|
| `api.ts` | Add API methods: startGame, submitGuess, saveDrawing, restartGame. Extend `RoomSnapshot` type. |
| `roomStore.ts` | Add store methods for new actions. Add auto-poll interval. |
| `LobbyPage.tsx` | Auto-poll on mount. Host-only start button. Show room code. |
| `GamePage.tsx` | Split view for drawer vs guesser. Wire canvas, guess form, scoreboard. |
| `GuessForm.tsx` | Working submit that calls API. |
| `Scoreboard.tsx` | Display live scores from snapshot. |
| `ResultPanel.tsx` | Show word, final scores, guess history. |
| New: `Canvas.tsx` | Drawing canvas component. |

## Implementation Sequence
1. Group 1: Host tracking, name validation, auto-poll, start precondition
2. Group 2: Game state machine, drawer assignment, word selection, per-viewer word visibility
3. Group 3: Canvas drawing, guess submission, scoring, guess history sync
4. Group 4: Result state, restart flow
